# Git workflow (FIRMA 1 / FIRMA-URUGLIK-1)

## Remote (remember permanently)

- **GitHub repo:** `https://github.com/Avazov03/FIRMA-URUGLIK-1.git`
- **Default branch:** `main`
- Remote name: `origin`
- **Project layout:** HTML sahifalar ildizda, stillar/skriptlar/rasmlar `assets/` ichida (eski `site/` papkasi yo‘q).

## After any project-changing work

1. When the user asks for a change that modifies the project (code, pages, assets, config), **ask first** in chat (also see `deploy-server.mdc`):
   - «Commit va git push qilaymi?»
   - «Serverga deploy qilaymi? (`agro.zonic.fit`)»
2. Only commit/push if the user says yes (or already ordered commit/push in the same message).
3. After a successful commit+push, reply with a short confirmation and mark done with a checkmark, e.g.:
   - ✅ Commit qildim
   - ✅ Push qildim (`origin/main`)
4. Do **not** commit secrets: `cookies.txt`, `.env`, credentials, tokens, SSH private keys.

## Commands (when approved)

```bash
git add ...
git commit -m "..."
git push -u origin main
```
